## Real-World Examples

### Example 1: ETL Pipeline

```python
from pyspark.sql.functions import *
from datetime import datetime

# Read raw data
df = spark.read.csv("raw_sales_data.csv", header=True, inferSchema=True)

# Transform
df_clean = df \
    .filter(col("amount") > 0) \
    .dropDuplicates(["order_id"]) \
    .withColumn("transaction_date", to_date(col("date"), "yyyy-MM-dd")) \
    .withColumn("year", year(col("transaction_date"))) \
    .withColumn("month", month(col("transaction_date"))) \
    .drop("date")

# Aggregate
sales_summary = df_clean.groupBy("year", "month", "product_category") \
    .agg(
        count("*").alias("num_transactions"),
        sum("amount").alias("total_sales"),
        avg("amount").alias("avg_sale"),
        min("amount").alias("min_sale"),
        max("amount").alias("max_sale")
    ) \
    .orderBy("year", "month")

# Load
sales_summary.write \
    .partitionBy("year", "month") \
    .mode("overwrite") \
    .parquet("s3://bucket/sales_summary")

print("ETL completed successfully")
```

